{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>From the creators of cult sleeper hit <strong>Scratches\u00a0</strong>and the haunting <strong>Serena</strong>, comes a chilling journey into the darkest depths of your mind.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/230210/extras/722adc6fc27e42e21960b84ffeb27886.poster.avif?t=1767112219\" width=780 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/230210/extras/722adc6fc27e42e21960b84ffeb27886.webm?t=1767112219\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/230210/extras/722adc6fc27e42e21960b84ffeb27886.mp4?t=1767112219\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ASYLUM</strong> is an ambitious first-person horror adventure casting you into the hallucinatory setting of the Hanwell Mental Institute. As an ex-patient suffering bizarre visions, you must explore the intricate layout of the building, research its past history, and march towards a shocking conclusion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/230210/extras/1b00129aa816a3a288addcca3d192e58.poster.avif?t=1767112219\" width=780 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/230210/extras/1b00129aa816a3a288addcca3d192e58.webm?t=1767112219\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/230210/extras/1b00129aa816a3a288addcca3d192e58.mp4?t=1767112219\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With influences ranging from Peter Cushing to Lucio Fulci, <strong>ASYLUM</strong> has been meticulously crafted with a strong focus on storytelling and atmosphere. Visit countless tenebrous environments, make your way through a towering, lifelike mental hospital, and solve compelling puzzles to find the answers you seek.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/230210/extras/c62ba0523a4e927ad5e11321b71f0d14.poster.avif?t=1767112219\" width=780 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/230210/extras/c62ba0523a4e927ad5e11321b71f0d14.webm?t=1767112219\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/230210/extras/c62ba0523a4e927ad5e11321b71f0d14.mp4?t=1767112219\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We poured our heart and soul into creating an involving and endlessly rewarding adventure. If you love the kind of slow-burning horror with an old-school sensibility that creeps upon you, <strong>ASYLUM</strong> will be an unforgettable experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/230210/extras/5622ab206e72f03b252f9e05f7786472.poster.avif?t=1767112219\" width=780 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/230210/extras/5622ab206e72f03b252f9e05f7786472.webm?t=1767112219\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/230210/extras/5622ab206e72f03b252f9e05f7786472.mp4?t=1767112219\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/230210/extras/aaebbec33e70d30141f185f6f81f84bc.avif?t=1767112219\" width=1560 height=200 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A mind-bending original storyline that we somehow managed to keep secret during 15 years of production.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Around 10 hours of gameplay \u2014\u00a0and that's without learning all the dark secrets!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > An atmosphere so engrossing you will almost smell the stench of decrepitude and putrefaction around you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Exciting challenges rewarding your wit and observation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Memorable soundtrack inspired by 80s horror films and quite a bit of John Carpenter. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > No jump scares! OK, maybe just a frightening handful that will hit you when you least expect them. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Diegetic interface and other buzz words.</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"8:00 PM","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/230210/9f425256ab6262e2c464da8f5a6aff72e593379e.jpg"},{"name":"9:00 PM","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/230210/78c31cb2b37471d40453d2b3c23838c7557021e6.jpg"},{"name":"10:00 PM","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/230210/8bf9cc490f46bad266b69e4d2fce2d134386ff91.jpg"},{"name":"11:00 PM","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/230210/ad85dced47957ddd7167c677d7956b52c3acf58c.jpg"},{"name":"12:00 AM","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/230210/1375ff3cccf55a53d6c1de28c809c959e9220ec4.jpg"},{"name":"1:00 AM","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/230210/2a6cf4e14e2f9932a60293c4d446cb1455ceb410.jpg"},{"name":"2:00 AM","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/230210/8b7df594467890fd82422b672689774469ef575e.jpg"},{"name":"3:00 AM","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/230210/bf1e3750c7b0d57f1b2fa65e4e180f645d20d166.jpg"},{"name":"4:00 AM","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/230210/3efbfaa4a249cc7324c4242bff22cf74ea6f9e23.jpg"},{"name":"5:00 AM","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/230210/6f57a39715378d2dc635f251b4b3fb12bfb55f06.jpg"}],"total":19},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/230210?t=1767112219","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/230210/9d86637c7f70e832cb28ee90f6b69fe0ec4a6fcc/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1767112219","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/230210/06f0c2abc374d443252d4068b42c16be85389b97/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767112219","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/230210/06f0c2abc374d443252d4068b42c16be85389b97/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767112219","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Some texts in the game include references to physical abuse, sexual assault, and self-harm. There are instances of graphical gore and blood."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>From the creators of cult sleeper hit <strong>Scratches\u00a0</strong>and the haunting <strong>Serena</strong>, comes a chilling journey into the darkest depths of your mind.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/230210/extras/722adc6fc27e42e21960b84ffeb27886.poster.avif?t=176711221